        },
        {
          "text": "Kuruga obu, Esau yanoba Yakobbo habw'omugisa ise ogu akaba amusabiire, yamalirra ati: “Ise nyowe ali haihi kufa, omu busumi obw'okumugaragarra, nubwo ndiita mugenzi wange Yakobbo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
